# Runway DLS (connected)

Design system source (markdown usage guidelines, not an npm component package):

- GitHub: https://github.com/cag-euxui/runway-md-components
- Local clone: `/Users/bell/runway-md-components`
- In this repo: `vendor/runway-md-components` → same clone
- Index: `vendor/runway-md-components/README.md`
- Component docs: `vendor/runway-md-components/docs/**/*.md`

## When building UI

1. Prefer tokens and patterns already in `src/index.css` + the `cag-dls` skill.
2. Before inventing a control (button, chip, input, toggle, header, etc.), open the matching Runway `.md` under `docs/` and follow its usage guidelines (anatomy, variants, do/don’t).
3. Common paths:
   - Buttons / chips: `docs/actions-interactions/`
   - Inputs / search: `docs/inputs/`
   - Checkboxes / radios / toggles: `docs/selections/`
   - Headers: `docs/page-navigations/`
4. This repo is **docs-only** — implement with local React + Tailwind/Runway tokens; do not expect importable React components from the clone.

